    "q-2204": {
      "dom_id": "step-q2204",
      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "Calculate $\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡(5z)\\,\\text{d}z.$",
      "worked_solution": "If we let $u=5z,$ then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}z}=5\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}z=\\frac{1}{5}\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡(5z)\\,\\text{d}z & =\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\cdot \\frac{1}{5}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{5}\\operatorname{cos}⁡u+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{5}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5z)+C\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-2204-a",
